# The claims that hold for any connected session, and touch nothing.
#
# The cheapest thing in the battery: if this refuses, the session is not
# what the rest of the battery assumes, and a failure further in would be
# read as a defect in the workflow rather than in the connection.
@name         session
@description  Read-only claims about a connected session.

pwd
expect path ${cwd} exists
expect gather size gte 0
